        "notes": "Killer Night contains scenes and themes that may not be suitable for all players. Mature content in the game includes:\r\n\r\nGraphic Violence: The game features scenes of intense violence, including fighting, serious injuries, and killings. Some scenes show gory and bloody details.\r\n\r\nDeath and Murder: The plot involves the discovery of murders and the fight for survival. Players will witness life-or-death situations, with characters dying in violent ways.\r\n\r\nThese elements are an integral part of the plot and gameplay experience, and have been included to create an atmosphere of tension and suspense. Discretion is advised for players sensitive to these issues."
